<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Tier List Project</title>

<style>
  * {
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial;
  }

  body {
    background:#111827;
    color:white;
  }

  header {
    background:#1f2937;
    padding:2rem;
    text-align:center;
  }

  nav a {
    color:white;
    margin:0 1rem;
    text-decoration:none;
  }

  nav a:hover {
    color:#60a5fa;
  }

  .container {
    padding:4rem 2rem;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
  }

  .card {
    background:#1f2937;
    padding:2.5rem;
    border-radius:12px;
    max-width:800px;
    width:100%;
  }

  h2 { margin-bottom:1rem; }

  p {
    color:#d1d5db;
    margin-bottom:1rem;
  }

  ul {
    color:#d1d5db;
  }

  .button {
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:1rem;
    background:#2563eb;
    padding:0.7rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius:8px;
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
  }

  .button:hover {
    background:#3b82f6;
  }
.screenshot-section {
  margin-top: 2rem;
}

.screenshot-section h2 {
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.screenshot-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
  gap: 1rem;
}

.screenshot-box {
  background: #111827;
  border: 2px dashed #374151;
  border-radius: 10px;
  height: 160px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  color: #9ca3af;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.screenshot-box img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>Tier List Project</h1>

  <nav>
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="about.html">About</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="container">
  <div class="card">

    <h2>Project Overview</h2>
    <p>
      This tier list tool allows users to rank items from best to worst.
    </p>

    <h2>My Role</h2>
    <p>
      I built the layout and implemented the ranking system logic.
    </p>

    <h2>Technologies Used</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>HTML</li>
      <li>CSS</li>
      <li>JavaScript</li>
    </ul>

    <a class="button" href="https://tier-list-eight.vercel.app/" target="_blank">
      Live Project
    </a>

  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
